=== Q: 《低俗小说》里朱尔斯开枪前说了什么？
stages: [('planning', 0), ('searching', 8), ('writing', 17)]  first token after 88s
sources: ['Pulp Fiction, scene 8 (part 5 of 8): INT. APARTMENT (ROOM 49) – MORNING', 'Pulp Fiction, scene 8 (part 6 of 8): INT. APARTMENT (ROOM 49) – MORNING', 'Pulp Fiction, scene 8 (part 4 of 8): INT. APARTMENT (ROOM 49) – MORNING', 'Pulp Fiction, scene 8 (part 2 of 8): INT. APARTMENT (ROOM 49) – MORNING']
timings: {'plan': 8.2, 'search': 9.0, 'answer': 82.1, 'total': 99.3}
A: 在《低俗小说》的这一稿剧本中，朱尔斯开枪前对布雷特说："Does-he-look-like-a-bitch?!"（他看起来像妓女吗？）[2] 之后他继续引用圣经经文，并与维克多同时向布雷特开枪。

=== Q: What does Red say about hope in The Shawshank Redemption?
stages: [('planning', 0), ('searching', 10), ('writing', 20)]  first token after 64s
sources: ["The Shawshank Redemption, scene 241: INT -- RED'S ROOM -- NIGHT", "The Shawshank Redemption, scene 246: INT -- RED'S ROOM -- DAY (1967)", "The Shawshank Redemption, scene 123 (part 1 of 2): INT -- RED'S CELL -- NIGHT (1957)", "The Shawshank Redemption, scene 33: INT -- RED'S CELL -- NIGHT (1947)"]
timings: {'plan': 9.8, 'search': 10.2, 'answer': 55.8, 'total': 75.7}
A: Red says, "Hope is a good thing, maybe the best of things, and no good thing ever dies." [3] He also mentions, "Hope is like the sun. You feel it even if you can't see it." [3] Additionally, he reflects on hope through his narration, stating, "Get busy living or get busy dying." [2]
